OL,3,GNEWSACall for health board boss to quit
OL,4,Aover patient safety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns over patient safety at a north
OL,7,FWales hospital have prompted a call for
OL,8,Fa health board chief executive to
OL,9,Fresign.
OL,11,FHealthcare Inspectorate Wales (HIW)
OL,12,Fvisited the emergency department at
OL,13,FYsbyty Glan Clwyd, Denbighshire, in May
OL,14,Fand said it needed "significant
OL,15,Fimprovements."
OL,17,FA follow-up last month found progress
OL,18,Fhad been made but challenges remained
OL,19,Fand "enhanced oversight" of the
OL,20,Fdepartment was still needed.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
