OL,3,GNEWSACall for health board boss to quit
OL,4,Aover patient safety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Millar, leader of the Welsh
OL,7,FConservatives, said "people are dying",
OL,8,Fadding Betsi Cadwaladr health board's
OL,9,Fchief executive Carol Shillabeer was
OL,10,F"clearly not able to do the job" and
OL,11,Fshould step down.
